-1 'UNIVERSITY OF MR' UNIVERSITY~
University of MR
----------------

The University was founded many centuries ago as a method of teaching
young men and women the arts of battle as well as other arts.  The
students of today however seem to see it as a way of life rather than
a temporary place of learning on the long journey.  Assassins have recently
been banned from the University as a result of an unfortunate incident
with the Chancellors daughter.  All are welcome to apply at the Secretary
for graduation.

University of MR was created by Health
Last updated 09 April 2001
~
0 $~




#RANGES 10 25 0 99
#MOBILES
