#19802
assassin guard~
the assassin guard~
The assassin guard walks around here.~
The scars of the assassin life play their toll on this aging man.  
You can still see the high-spiritedness that he maintained as a youth 
and young adult, but time and numerous kills have given him definate 
signs of aging.~
