>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 1
  if quest(1,1,$n) == 0
    scream $n
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'WOW! The first time you have shown up for class all year!'
    mpechoat $n The teacher calms herself.
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'Now, I know why you are here.'
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'But first, you must answer correctly this question:'
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'What is the name of the ruler of a public university?'
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog president~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 1
  if quest(1,1,$n) == 0
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'Very good.'
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'You have passed your final test.'
    mpoload 19830
    give report $n
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'Here is your grade report.'
    mpmadd $n quest 1 1 1
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog chancellor~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 1
  if quest(1,1,$n) == 0
    chuckle 
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'WRONG! You nitwit!'
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'The ruler of a private university is a chancellor.'
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'The ruler of a *public* university is a president.'
    mpechoat $n The professor says 'Go back where ya came from!'
    mptransfer $n 9755
  endif
endif
~
|
#19835
chancellor~
The Chancellor~
The chancellor sits here, in all his glory.~
He is the ruler of this entire University.  All executive decisions must go
