>all_greet_prog 0~
if quest(20,1,$n) == 0
  mpechoat $n A voice whispers in your ear:
  mpechoat $n Welcome to the new, improved University.
  mpechoat $n .
  mpechoat $n The gods have transformed this grand institution to a place more worthy of
  mpechoat $n the great land.  Hence, you will notice that many things are not quite
  mpechoat $n what they previously were.  Please keep this in mind as you explore, and
  mpechoat $n perhaps re-explore the university.
  mpechoat $n .
  mpechoat $n - Many items have undergone name changes, but are still the same stats.
  mpechoat $n - More mobs have been added to various areas.
  mpechoat $n - The Chancellor has cancelled the rogue and assassin guilds.
  mpechoat $n - The mortician quit, and Alice has taken over his job.
  mpmset $n quest 20 1 1
endif
~
