  WELCOME TO THE UNIVERSITY OF MORTAL REALMS!

    To make your stay more pleasant, please make sure that you
    are at least level 10.  Any lower and you enter at your own
    risk.  We are not liable for any damages that may occur on
    these grounds.  If you wish to leave now, go south.


Underneath that is a smaller sign.~
